// Dialog :
"P3631181763" "Excellent work, {VillainName}. My patient will be most pleased. I should have told you, my patient is an influential man here on the island. He'll want to know about your work on his behalf."
// RandomFameString :
"P1071289182" "I hear {VillainName} stole some equipment right out of an Arachnos base!"

