// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3641809263" "So, Aeon was involved in Midas' acquisition of power, eh? Well, it doesn't surprise me. Aeon's almost as curious about the super powers as I am, and he certainly has better funding. If I analyze these fragments with the equipment you appropriated, I may be able to figure out how to get a needle through that ultra-hard skin of Midas'. Then I could cure him."
// RandomFameString :
"P2164123589" "I hear not even Aeon's security forces can stand up to {VillainName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P218250391" "We're in trouble, {VillainName}. I wasn't able to cook up a way of piercing Midas' skin to deliver the cure, but I did manage to concoct a medicine that could be absorbed through it. Problem is, Aeon heard about my experiments with Midas' skin, and he wants my findings for himself. And guess who he's sent after them? The Goldbrickers! Midas has no idea he's sending men to snatch the substance that could save his life. And he's not going to find out. If he does, he'll know that I lied to him about his condition, and that can't happen. So I need you to get to my lab and make sure my work stays intact and on the premises. <br><br>I have to warn you, {VillainName}. There's a chance you could fail this one."
// AcceptString :
"P3134009236" "Save Dr. Percey's work"
// SendOffString :
"P1146805769" "I'm not saying you got sloppy and led Aeon straight to us. I'm just saying we need this situation taken care of."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P325543414" "Uh, hello? My lab, the Goldbrickers, imminent destruction? Get on it!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3872168502" "Dr. Percey has more expensive equipment than she claims. She must have hidden resources."

