// Dialog :
"P927616339" "Thanks to you, Midas will never have to know how close he came to death. You saved my equipment and along with it, Midas' life. I'll put in a good word for you with old Midas; maybe the two of you can do business together in the future. <br><br>Listen, I hope you can keep whatever secrets you've learned about me during this adventure. Take this salvage. Remember: I'm your friend. You can trust me."
// RandomFameString :
"P704993933" "I hear {VillainName} took down a slew of Goldbrickers!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2267333486" "My lab! My work! All my hard won discoveries! I can't tell you the sacrifices I've had to make for my work, {VillainName}. Really, I can't. I'll do what I can to help Midas, but I fear he may not be long for this world. At least it'll make for one heckuva interesting autopsy."
// RandomFameString :
"P3894143016" "I hear {VillainName} got owned by the Goldbrickers!"

